# Committed on purpose: the Vercel project does not define these, so the production
# build reads them from this file. They are public by design — Vite inlines every
# VITE_* value into the client bundle, and Supabase RLS is what protects the data.
#
# NEVER put real secrets here (API keys with write access, passwords, service-role
# keys). Local-only secrets belong in .env.local, which is gitignored.
